---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="AI-Powered Operations Intelligence — Alfonso Palma"
    />
    <title>AI-Powered Operations Intelligence — Alfonso Palma</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="navbar">
      <a href="/" class="logo">AP.</a>

      <a href="/" class="back">← Back to portfolio</a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">Case Study · Data & AI</p>

        <h1>
          AI-Powered<br />
          Operations <span>Intelligence.</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="hero-grid">
          <p class="intro">
            A centralized operational intelligence system designed to turn
            fragmented restaurant data into decision-ready information.
          </p>

          <div class="meta">
            <div>
              <span>ROLE</span>
              <strong>Operations & Technology</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>FOCUS</span>
              <strong>Analytics · BI · AI</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>ENVIRONMENT</span>
              <strong>Multi-brand restaurant operations</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="impact">
        <div class="impact-item">
          <span>01</span>
          <strong>4+ brands</strong>
          <p>Operational data consolidated across multiple restaurant concepts.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="impact-item">
          <span>02</span>
          <strong>Daily visibility</strong>
          <p>Centralized KPIs used for recurring operational decision-making.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="impact-item">
          <span>03</span>
          <strong>AI-assisted analysis</strong>
          <p>Natural-language interaction with operational data through Goose.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section">
        <div class="section-label">
          <span>01</span>
          <p>The context</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>
            The business had data.<br />
            The problem was <span>using it.</span>
          </h2>

          <p>
            Operational information was distributed across different systems,
            restaurant locations and workflows. Sales, costs, inventory and
            performance indicators required manual consolidation before they
            could be analyzed.
          </p>

          <p>
            The challenge was not simply creating another dashboard. The goal
            was to build a reliable data layer that could support daily
            operational decisions and make information easier to access.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section dark">
        <div class="section-label">
          <span>02</span>
          <p>The solution</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>
            From fragmented systems to a
            <span>single operational view.</span>
          </h2>

          <p>
            I designed a centralized analytics workflow that integrates
            operational data into a structured SQL environment and exposes key
            business indicators through Power BI.
          </p>

          <p>
            An AI layer using Goose was added to make the data more accessible,
            allowing operational questions to be explored through natural
            language instead of requiring every analysis to start from a new
            report or query.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="architecture">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">System architecture</p>
          <h2>How the pieces connect.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="architecture-flow">
          <div class="architecture-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Operational Sources</h3>
            <p>POS, ERP, inventory and operational datasets.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="connector">→</div>

          <div class="architecture-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <Icon name="simple-icons:postgresql" />
            <h3>PostgreSQL</h3>
            <p>Centralized and structured analytical data layer.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="connector">→</div>

          <div class="architecture-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <Icon name="simple-icons:powerbi" />
            <h3>Power BI</h3>
            <p>Operational dashboards and recurring KPI monitoring.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="connector">→</div>

          <div class="architecture-card">
            <span>04</span>
            <div class="goose">GOOSE</div>
            <h3>AI Layer</h3>
            <p>Natural-language exploration of operational information.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section">
        <div class="section-label">
          <span>03</span>
          <p>Business value</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>
            Less time gathering data.<br />
            More time <span>acting on it.</span>
          </h2>

          <div class="value-grid">
            <div>
              <span>01</span>
              <strong>Centralized visibility</strong>
              <p>
                Multiple operational sources can be reviewed from a unified
                analytical environment.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>02</span>
              <strong>Faster analysis</strong>
              <p>
                Recurring questions no longer require rebuilding reports from
                fragmented files.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>03</span>
              <strong>Earlier detection</strong>
              <p>
                Cost, pricing and operational anomalies become easier to identify
                and investigate.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>04</span>
              <strong>Accessible analytics</strong>
              <p>
                AI-assisted querying reduces the technical barrier between
                business questions and operational data.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="technology">
        <p class="eyebrow">Technology</p>

        <div class="tech-grid">
          <div>
            <Icon name="simple-icons:postgresql" />
            <span>PostgreSQL</span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <Icon name="simple-icons:powerbi" />
            <span>Power BI</span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="goose small">G</div>
            <span>Goose</span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="api">API</span>
            <span>Data Integration</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="visual">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Project visual</p>
          <h2>Dashboard preview.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="placeholder">
          <span>ANONYMIZED DASHBOARD</span>
          <p>Screenshot will be added here.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="next">
        <p>Next case study</p>

        <a href="/">
          Demand Forecasting &<br />
          Purchasing Automation →
        </a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <span>© 2026 Alfonso Palma</span>
      <a href="/">Back to portfolio ↑</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: #F7F7F5;
    color: #111111;
    font-family:
      Inter,
      ui-sans-serif,
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      BlinkMacSystemFont,
      "Segoe UI",
      sans-serif;
  }

  :global(a) {
    color: inherit;
  }

  .navbar,
  .hero,
  .impact,
  .content-section,
  .architecture,
  .technology,
  .visual,
  .next,
  footer {
    width: min(1400px, calc(100% - 64px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .navbar {
    height: 92px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d3cd;
  }

  .logo {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .back {
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 110px 0 120px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 30px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #6B6B66;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 1200px;
    font-size: clamp(66px, 9vw, 145px);
    line-height: 0.86;
    letter-spacing: -0.075em;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .hero h1 span,
  .section-content h2 span {
    color: #8A7F6A;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 100px;
    margin-top: 90px;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 630px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #6B6B66;
  }

  .meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .meta div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 9px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid #d4d3cd;
  }

  .meta span {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #6B6B66;
  }

  .meta strong {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .impact {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
  }

  .impact-item {
    padding: 45px 34px;
  }

  .impact-item + .impact-item {
    border-left: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
  }

  .impact-item > span {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #6B6B66;
  }

  .impact-item strong {
    display: block;
    margin: 50px 0 14px;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 58px);
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .impact-item p {
    max-width: 360px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #6B6B66;
  }

  .content-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.35fr 1fr;
    gap: 100px;
    padding: 140px 0;
  }

  .section-label {
    display: flex;
    gap: 18px;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #6B6B66;
  }

  .section-label p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .section-content {
    max-width: 920px;
  }

  .section-content h2 {
    margin: 0 0 60px;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 90px);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .section-content > p {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #6B6B66;
  }

  .dark {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    padding-inline: max(32px, calc((100vw - 1400px) / 2));
    background: #111111;
    color: #F7F7F5;
  }

  .dark .section-label,
  .dark .section-content > p {
    color: #a4a39c;
  }

  .architecture {
    padding: 140px 0;
  }

  .section-heading h2,
  .visual h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 90px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .architecture-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 80px;
  }

  .architecture-card {
    min-height: 310px;
    padding: 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
  }

  .architecture-card > span {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #6B6B66;
  }

  .architecture-card :global(svg) {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .architecture-card h3 {
    margin: auto 0 12px;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .architecture-card p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #6B6B66;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .connector {
    color: #8A7F6A;
    font-size: 22px;
  }

  .goose {
    width: fit-content;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding: 7px 9px;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .value-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    margin-top: 75px;
    border-top: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
  }

  .value-grid div {
    min-height: 220px;
    padding: 28px 28px 28px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
  }

  .value-grid div:nth-child(odd) {
    border-right: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
  }

  .value-grid div:nth-child(even) {
    padding-left: 28px;
  }

  .value-grid span {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #6B6B66;
  }

  .value-grid strong {
    display: block;
    margin: 45px 0 12px;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .value-grid p {
    max-width: 390px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #6B6B66;
  }

  .technology {
    padding: 120px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
  }

  .tech-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    margin-top: 50px;
    border-top: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
  }

  .tech-grid > div {
    min-height: 180px;
    padding: 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .tech-grid > div + div {
    border-left: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
  }

  .tech-grid :global(svg) {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
  }

  .tech-grid span:last-child {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .small {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .api {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .visual {
    padding: 120px 0 140px;
  }

  .placeholder {
    min-height: 620px;
    margin-top: 70px;
    display: grid;
    place-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    background: #111111;
    color: #F7F7F5;
  }

  .placeholder span {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: #8A7F6A;
  }

  .placeholder p {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: #8c8b84;
  }

  .next {
    padding: 120px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
  }

  .next p {
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #6B6B66;
  }

  .next a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 30px;
    font-size: clamp(45px, 6vw, 88px);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  footer {
    padding: 28px 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-top: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #6B6B66;
  }

  footer a {
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .navbar,
    .hero,
    .impact,
    .content-section,
    .architecture,
    .technology,
    .visual,
    .next,
    footer {
      width: calc(100% - 40px);
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .hero-grid,
    .content-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 55px;
    }

    .meta,
    .impact,
    .tech-grid,
    .value-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .impact-item + .impact-item,
    .tech-grid > div + div {
      border-left: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #c9c8c1;
    }

    .architecture-flow {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .connector {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      justify-self: center;
    }

    .dark {
      width: 100%;
      padding-inline: 20px;
    }

    .value-grid div:nth-child(odd) {
      border-right: none;
    }

    .value-grid div:nth-child(even) {
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .placeholder {
      min-height: 420px;
    }
  }
</style>
